    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Impersonal meaning",
     "texto": [
      "«Man» doesn't refer to a specific individual, but to people in general or to anyone. It shouldn't be confused with «der Mann» (the man)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Combination with modals",
     "texto": [
      "**Man darf** = it's allowed; **Man darf nicht** = it's forbidden.",
      "**Man muss** = it's compulsory / you have to; **Man muss nicht** = it isn't necessary.",
      "**Man kann** = you can / it's possible."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
